\n3468 | \n3469 |         Upsample the series into 30 second bins.\n3470 | \n3471 |         >>> df.groupby(\"a\").resample(\"30s\", include_groups=False).sum()\n3472 |                             b\n3473 |         a\n3474 |         0   2000-01-01 00:00:00  1\n3475 |             2000-01-01 00:00:30  0\n3476 |             2000-01-01 00:01:00  1\n3477 |             2000-01-01 00:01:30  0\n3478 |             2000-01-01 00:02:00  0\n3479 |             2000-01-01 00:02:30  0\n3480 |             2000-01-01 00:03:00  1\n3481 |         5   2000-01-01 00:02:00  1\n3482 | \n3483 |         Resample by month. Values are assigned to the month of the period.\n3484 | \n3485 |         >>> df.groupby(\"a\").resample(\"ME\", include_groups=False).sum()\n3486 |                     b\n3487 |         a\n3488 |         0   2000-01-31  3\n3489 |         5   2000-01-31  1\n3490 | \n3491 |         Downsample the series into 3 minute bins as above, but close the right\n3492 |         side of the bin interval.\n3493 | \n3494 |         >>> (\n3495 |         ...     df.groupby(\"a\")\n3496 |         ...     .resample(\"3min\", closed=\"right\", include_groups=False)\n3497 |         ...     .sum()\n3498 |         ... )\n3499 |                                  b\n3500 |         a\n3501 |         0   1999-12-31 23:57:00  1\n3502 |             2000-01-01 00:00:00  2\n3503 |         5   2000-01-01 00:00:00  1\n3504 | \n3505 |         Downsample the series into 3 minute bins and close the right side of\n3506 |         the bin interval, but label each bin using the right edge instead of\n3507 |         the left.\n3508 | \n3509 |         >>> (\n3510 |         ...     df.groupby(\"a\")\n3511 |         ...     .resample(\"3min\", closed=\"right\", label=\"right\", include_groups=False)\n3512 |         ...     .sum()\n3513 |         ... )\n3514 |                                  b\n3515 |         a\n3516 |         0   2000-01-01 00:00:00  1\n3517 |             2000-01-01 00:03:00  2\n3518 |         5   200